&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About CoVar&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW104595359 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104595359 BCX0&quot;&gt;CoVar is a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104595359 BCX0&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104595359 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;AI/ML R&amp;amp;D software company with offices in Durham, NC and McLean, VA, that uses artificial intelligence to solve problems that matter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104595359 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Our teams build AI/ML solutions that help the DoD detect enemies and threats, help biomedical researchers find new cures, and help&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104595359 BCX0&quot;&gt;monitor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104595359 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;machinery to prevent injuries and environmental catastrophes. We are passionate engineers dedicated to pushing the bounds of what AI/ML can do in the real world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW104595359 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;CoVar is&amp;nbsp;seeking&amp;nbsp;a highly experienced combat arms professional to help productize and integrate its&amp;nbsp;state-of-the-art&amp;nbsp;Aided Target Recognition (AiTR) technology into US Army combat arms units.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;draw on your operational credibility and military experience to build relationships with Army leadership, demonstrate CoVar’s technology on unit equipment, and serve as the critical link between units using our&amp;nbsp;AiTR&amp;nbsp;and CoVar’s engineering team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for a former senior NCO who understands combat arms formations from the inside out, is comfortable briefing commanders and their teams at every&amp;nbsp;echelon, and&amp;nbsp;wants to shape how the Army adopts next-generation targeting technology. As CoVar&#39;s&amp;nbsp;DoD-facing work grows, this role may expand to support&amp;nbsp;additional&amp;nbsp;programs beyond&amp;nbsp;AiTR.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Build strategic relationships:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Engage with Brigade, Division, and Corps level leadership to build relationships and awareness of CoVar&amp;nbsp;AiTR&amp;nbsp;product capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Support unit-level fielding:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Liaise with Battalion-level leadership to understand,&amp;nbsp;demonstrate, and field CoVar&amp;nbsp;AiTR&amp;nbsp;systems on unit equipment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Travel to support the force:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Travel to unit locations to&amp;nbsp;demonstrate&amp;nbsp;and troubleshoot CoVar&amp;nbsp;AiTR&amp;nbsp;systems on unit equipment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Brief commanders and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;their teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Prepare and deliver product integration and&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;briefs for unit commanders and their&amp;nbsp;teams, whether selling&amp;nbsp;new technologies&amp;nbsp;or explaining fielded ones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Inform engineering with operational insight:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Provide insight to CoVar engineers on using-unit equipment, doctrine, SOPs, and TTPs related to camera-based fire control, C2, and/or ISR systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[720,360],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[0,8]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;MOS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Served in MOS 11-series or 19-series.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Rank:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Retired or separated at the rank of E8 or E9 (11Z6O or 19Z6O preferred).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Key &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;additional&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;skill identifiers:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;J3, A8, K8, or R8.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Clearance:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Eligibility for a US security clearance is&amp;nbsp;required; an active Secret clearance or above is preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[720,360],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[0,8]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary, cash bonus, equity structure, and 401k with employer contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent health care coverage, including dental and vision plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short-term and long-term disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PTO and paid holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit us: www.covar.com&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Machine Learning Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW29176374 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW29176374 BCX0&quot;&gt;Location: McLean, VA (hybrid); occasional travel to Durham,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW29176374 BCX0&quot;&gt;NC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW29176374 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and customer sites&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW29176374 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About CoVar&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;CoVar is a small AI/ML R&amp;amp;D software company with offices in Durham, NC and McLean, VA, that uses artificial intelligence to solve problems that matter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;Our teams build AI/ML solutions that&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;help the DoD&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;detect&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;enemies and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;threats,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;help&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;biomedical researchers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;find new cures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;help&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;monitor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;machinery&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;prevent injuries and environmental catastrophes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;passionate engineers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;dedicated to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;pushing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;bounds&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;of what AI/ML can do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;in the real&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot;&gt;world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW130179861 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;seeking a Senior ML Engineer (Technical Lead) with deep hands-on&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;in machine learning and computer vision, who can also lead DoD-focused programs, own customer engagement, contribute to business development, and help grow and manage a local engineering team in McLean over time.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;lead end-to-end technical delivery&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;from data to deployment&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;while serving as the primary technical point of contact for our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for someone who enjoys building production-grade ML systems, mentoring engineers, and translating complex technical work into compelling customer outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;You’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
